{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> Even if you don't play games often,</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You might be able to see the ending an hour after you pick up this game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Introduction</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hoshi_no_Natchan&quot; is a retro style pixel art 2D action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was appearanced so that even people who are not very good at games can experience the fun of clearing the game. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wow you went ahead!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You jump well!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You are great at collecting stars!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It's cool when you fight the enemy!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > It's cute even if you make a mistake!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Even if you get game over, you keep trying and don't give up!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's hope you reach the goal! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I would be happy if you could think, &quot;Games are fun!&quot; through this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What kind of game is it? </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a 2D action game that mainly uses the <strong>control key</strong>, <strong>jump button</strong> and <strong>attack button</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aim for the goal star and move forward through the four stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There will also be enemies that will block Hoshi_no_Natchan's path.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat them by stepping on them or attacking them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > Features? </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flick away</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you defeat an enemy with an attack, you can send the enemy flying.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It often happens that the enemy you bounce back hits another enemy...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy Dash</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeating enemies will increase your dash energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Having dash energy will make you dash faster for a short time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FOR SUPER PLAYERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you are confident in your ability, try reducing vitality, stock, and time from the options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is easy to clear, so you can play with a high score (or low score) or aim for a clear time.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Congratulations! / \u304a\u3081\u3067\u3068\u3046\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733640/ef60791973f57fc64d229139e9c68322787018f6.jpg"},{"name":"Around the Polloop! / \u30dd\u30eb\u30eb\u30fc\u30d7\u3092\u3072\u3068\u307e\u308f\u308a\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733640/7179ce746d4acd0bdaeb5a6e653d58aad2e34b27.jpg"},{"name":"Many Stars! : \u661f\u304c\u3044\u3063\u3071\u3044\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733640/fe64012c2a82c79c4ca56c8a4f11c35eceb68160.jpg"},{"name":"Fast Clear! : \u9ad8\u901f\u30af\u30ea\u30a2\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733640/2afa7fd976edf5012b618d56fd7f8d74a493f862.jpg"},{"name":"Few Jumps! : \u30b8\u30e3\u30f3\u30d7\u306f\u5c11\u3057\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2733640/df2b9ced1d27aa5fecad5c338934dce6555430d2.jpg"},{"name":"Graciousness Mind! : \u6ea2\u308c\u308b\u512a\u3057\u3055\uff01","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunit